<!--
    English localization.

    Terminology convention (agreed with the project owner):
    - 遮罩 / 启动遮罩  -> "SplashScreen" (the platform's native splash screen surface),
                         NOT the literal "mask"/"overlay". Chinese sources in this
                         module occasionally use 遮罩 loosely to mean any startup
                         cover, but the technical referent is always Android's
                         SplashScreen API surface.
    - 热启动          -> "warm start" (activity already alive in the background)
    - 冷启动          -> "cold start"
    - 莫奈 / 动态取色 -> "Material You dynamic color"
    - 几何形变        -> "morph" (Material 3 Expressive morph-shaped loading indicator)
    - 指示器          -> "indicator"
-->
